              <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Nodule size</span><span class="spec-val">8mm – 25mm (adjustable via speed, angle, and water addition)</span></div>
              <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Capacity</span><span class="spec-val">1 TPH – 30 TPH depending on pan size</span></div>
