              <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Pressure differential</span><span class="spec-val">Up to 1.0 bar across the valve</span></div>
              <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Rotor vanes</span><span class="spec-val">6 or 8 vane; open or closed-end rotor types</span></div>
              <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Housing material</span><span class="spec-val">Cast iron (standard), MS fabricated, SS 304/316 for food/chemical</span></div>
              <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Drive</span><span class="spec-val">Gearbox motor; VFD for variable throughput</span></div>
